flowchart LR
  A[Cardholder] --> B[Supported Wallet] 
  B -->|Tokenized credential + required cryptogram data| C[Merchant / PSP]
  C --> D[Acquirer / Processor]
  D --> E[Card Network]
  E --> F[Issuer Bank]
  F -->|Approve / Decline| E
  E --> D --> C
  C --> G[Capture, Clearing, Settlement]
  G --> H[Merchant Reconciliation]
